#
# Single source of truth for the Role Profiles registry read by the build (profilo.json files and the kit).
# The first line that is not a comment is the full commit SHA of eiraman/role-profiles, never a branch.
# Read by generator/build.py (which refuses a checkout at another commit) and by
# .github/workflows/site-build.yml. Updating it is a reviewed change, with the registry version below.
# Registry version: 0.11.0
# Before release this must be the published commit of eiraman/role-profiles (publication order: guide, role-profiles, site).
